{
  "_comment": [
    "describe-stacks for the cleanup-aws.sh tests. Stack names are the real ones:",
    "deploy.sh builds voicenotes-<instance>, bootstrap.sh builds voicenotes-bootstrap.",
    "Each entry exists to drive one branch:",
    "  voicenotes-dev         healthy; its resources ARE the claim set",
    "  voicenotes-dev-failed  ROLLBACK_COMPLETE - the orphan a failed deploy leaves",
    "  voicenotes-bootstrap   also ROLLBACK_COMPLETE, but shared: reported, never swept",
    "  voicenotes-dev-stuck   UPDATE_ROLLBACK_FAILED - wants an operator, not a sweep",
    "  passbook-prod          another project, also failed. The account really does host",
    "                         passbook (§10.3); touching it is the catastrophe this",
    "                         script exists to avoid, so a test proves it is left alone."
  ],
